# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of the handbook [[cite:obs-72261f0cf7280ae26d9f544af3dedcaa7f497423 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline as the time limit [[cite:obs-89e619fbc387e518e967628f6a41cf9546a69f14 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].
